{"id":"vod_sn_39024","vodId":"39024","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"魔神坛斗士","name_cn":"魔神坛斗士","date":"1988-01-01","year":"1988","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/2aa06fc649b973150e9a5566603f2a84.jpg"},"summary":"在遥远的神话时代，人类私欲膨胀，相互残杀，人世间血雨腥风，哀鸿遍野。人类仇恨的力量创造了妖邪界及其魔王霸主阿罗醐，阿罗醐的出现是人类的命运更加黯淡无光。这时，身穿金色铠甲的勇士迦雄须出现，打败了阿罗醐，还世界以光明。然阿罗醐虽死，其聚集了邪念铠甲却还留存世间。为了抑制住邪恶的力量，迦雄须用“仁、义、礼、智、信、忠、孝、悌、忍”九种人类精神将其封印。　　一千年倏忽而去，公元1988年，妖邪帝王之城阿罗醐城出现东京上空，黑暗再次降临。就在人类世界危在旦夕之时，五位身穿铠甲救世主挺身而出……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:06:40","playable":true,"episodeCount":39,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/iPHfMNUTLX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/Qq6pyHqNSd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/cwEZyniCpx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/M28JkHHntf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/6UxD5YvDsh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/NzavZSicsm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/fqUFDhSA3t1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/pjFhf4FzwT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/00m2hjBqAD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/RBZSA9AA2R1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/LVaqVUNkKL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/dMdDCN7nFb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/C3a4RmvXnN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/jkM92E1HRk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/7g